 the two at-will tenancies is $1,570,093.50 (66.9%).\\n- **Critical: Apex ROFR.** Article XIII is triggered by a *portfolio* sale and requires notice *before* the seller executes — the PSA was signed 15 Nov 2024 over a portfolio containing Building C.\\n- **GSA lease is senior to any mortgage and cannot be assigned without federal consent** — obstacles to financing and to an asset-level closing.\\n- **Verdana expansion option** fixes below-market rent on a further 18,500 RSF with a $740,000 allowance; the window is already open.\\n- **Three rent schedules break their own escalation formulas** (Apex Yr 5, BrightPath Yr 8, Southeastern Yr 10). Net current-year overstatement **$7,265**, concentrated in the Southeastern holdover ($9,240). Verdana, Soto and GSA conform.\\n- **Only 2 of 7 leases oblige a tenant estoppel; no SNDA exists for any lease.**\\n- Minor date inconsistency in the engagement letter itself (77-day DD period is 76 days from the stated start date).\\n\\nEach finding is tied to a numbered risk (R-01…R-26) with a severity, timing band, and an assigned action and deadline in §8, sequenced against the 31 Jan 2025 due-diligence expiry and 15 Mar 2025 target closing.\\n\"}", "result": "Wrote 2986 bytes to response.md"}
